    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Find us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7c590b3571f8f80a976201c12bb95ed7.avif?t=1752876659\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X </strong>@AdaEden1001 |\u00a0<strong>Tiktok &amp; IG</strong>\u00a0@1001nights.ai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our <strong>Discord</strong> through the right sidebar!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/4f38f41ac248722855f950693afd0ceb.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where the power of stories shapes reality, driven by unique intelligent narrative system...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapted from Persian folklore: The brutal and bloodthirsty King Shahryar, consumed by rage after his wife's betrayal, takes a new bride each day only to cruelly execute her at dawn. You are Scheherazade, his next victim...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you end his reign of terror by literally telling stories? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/c2bd3170752aebdc186a103b36f3c9b1.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspired by Wittgenstein's notion: &quot;The limits of my language mean the limits of my world.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination! Tell captivating tales to intrigue the merciless King through typing. Cleverly guide him to mention words like 'sword', 'knife', or 'shield' in his responses - watch as they magically materialize into real weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought to life by our unique intelligent narrative system, each story is a one-of-a-kind creation - completely unscripted! But beware... strange words might provoke the King's deadly wrath...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/093c4eda13e472d4e0fe52f65f535130.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect weapons forged from your stories! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generated in real-time based on your narratives! From shawarma kitchen knives to witch's spears... every weapon is one of a kind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7487dbd548166887e04aefc0ec8facf8.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle the King in a world born from your tales! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is an unprecedented theatrical performance - weapon effects and even character dialogues spring from the stories you've crafted!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Crafting Game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by innovative storytelling mechanics as the core gameplay. This unique experience combines creative writing with strategic gameplay. Award-winning design ensures every story is unique!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art Aesthetics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features distinctive pixel art and hand-drawn illustrations! All artwork is lovingly created by human artists to bring your stories to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Traditional Norms:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from ancient patriarchal constraints with Scheherazade!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academic Foundation:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just a game - it's an academic and artistic project. We've published two papers on the game's systems, hoping to inspire more novel games!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/4f38f41ac248722855f950693afd0ceb.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where the power of stories shapes reality, driven by unique intelligent narrative system...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapted from Persian folklore: The brutal and bloodthirsty King Shahryar, consumed by rage after his wife's betrayal, takes a new bride each day only to cruelly execute her at dawn. You are Scheherazade, his next victim...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you end his reign of terror by literally telling stories? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/c2bd3170752aebdc186a103b36f3c9b1.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7cc6940fd4ca85b5e65195f5d52d3aca.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspired by Wittgenstein's notion: &quot;The limits of my language mean the limits of my world.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination! Tell captivating tales to intrigue the merciless King through typing. Cleverly guide him to mention words like 'sword', 'knife', or 'shield' in his responses - watch as they magically materialize into real weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought to life by our unique intelligent narrative system, each story is a one-of-a-kind creation - completely unscripted! But beware... strange words might provoke the King's deadly wrath...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/093c4eda13e472d4e0fe52f65f535130.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/6e4a8fb81c71784202ba4adcad6ffeed.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect weapons forged from your stories! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generated in real-time based on your narratives! From shawarma kitchen knives to witch's spears... every weapon is one of a kind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/7487dbd548166887e04aefc0ec8facf8.avif?t=1752876659\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.poster.avif?t=1752876659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.webm?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542850/extras/69a4bb1a68dec5ad6cb61c9950575070.mp4?t=1752876659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle the King in a world born from your tales! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is an unprecedented theatrical performance - weapon effects and even character dialogues spring from the stories you've crafted!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Crafting Game:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by innovative storytelling mechanics as the core gameplay. This unique experience combines creative writing with strategic gameplay. Award-winning design ensures every story is unique!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Art Aesthetics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features distinctive pixel art and hand-drawn illustrations! All artwork is lovingly created by human artists to bring your stories to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Traditional Norms:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break free from ancient patriarchal constraints with Scheherazade!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academic Foundation:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just a game - it's an academic and artistic project. We've published two papers on the game's systems, hoping to inspire more novel games!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Can you survive an evil King who kills a bride every night by telling stories? A story-crafting game based on a unique narrative system \u2014 Become the storyteller Scheherazade from Persian folklore, weave tales to the King through typing, and guide his words to forge magical weapons for your revenge!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe concept is so great, I was amazed of how well it worked! That games power is endless.\u201d<br>AMaze Award<br><br>\u201cPresents a unique and groundbreaking concept by combining technology to enable real-time co-creative storytelling.\u201d<br>SIGGRAPH Asia<br>",
